            "review_title": "Review at Bún bò Huế Đông Ba - Since 1998",
            "review_text": "Viet D\n1 contribution\n0\nTop Bun Bo In HCM\nJun 2026 • Solo\nOne of the best Bun Bo Hue spots in Ho Chi Minh City, and very popular with locals. The broth is rich and flavorful, the beef is tender, and the homemade chili paste adds a great aroma and extra flavor.\n\nThey also serve tasty Banh Beo and Banh Bot Loc, which are worth trying. Friendly service and reasonable prices. Open daily from 6:00 AM to 10:00 PM.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 4, 2026",
