            "review_text": "スパマキシマム\nNagoya, Japan5741 contributions\n0\nThe meaty Boom Bo Hue Special!\nSep 2024 • Solo\n\"BÚN BÒ HUẾ ĐÔNG BA\" in Ho Chi Minh City\nCopy and paste the name of the restaurant into the taxi app Grab\nI went there around 6:20 a.m.\n\nIt's not just pho in Vietnamese noodle dishes.\nThe noodles like udon, bumbo hue, are also popular!\n\nI was surprised by the grass like I'd never seen before.\nBun Bo Hue Special is meaty\nIt was really delicious!!\nRead more\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten October 17, 2024",
